{"id":"vod_sn_127036","vodId":"127036","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"野原广志午餐流派","name_cn":"野原广志午餐流派","date":"2025-01-01","year":"2025","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20251004-1/f44d15cd8c62ab9981c61f5f31186649.jpg"},"summary":"原作漫画作者是塚原洋一，作品讲述了在《蜡笔小新》系列中未曾展现的、作为上班族为家庭工作的广志在有限的零花钱和时间中，对午餐的极致追求。广志不仅以美食评论的方式品尝美味，还包含了各种料理的冷知识和制作方法，以及上班族特有的“请后辈吃饭的烦恼”、“业务间隙的快餐”、“对上司的抱怨”等职场人士的共鸣点，因此得到了 20 至 30 岁男女的广泛共鸣。此外，该衍生作还融入了《蜡笔小新》特有的幽默，以及广志在品尝“热辣”、“辛辣”、“甜美”等不同料理时展现的各种“颜艺”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-12-19 23:26:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202510/04/rkGTMXRe0v21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202510/10/dSb8KDZD0722/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202510/18/ZFKayn0H6U24/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202510/25/avjcd8sYKD22/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202510/31/BaaxVBptSg19/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202511/07/rzKaZS2Qp119/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202511/14/q7cLLgeyyc19/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202511/21/ARv2vaiga221/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202511/28/8mifRdu39b20/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202512/05/ewHHYXWLGZ22/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202512/12/ZA9tW3GUuH22/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202512/19/nAL1YGkita22/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:39.732Z"}